OL,5,G0130 The Genesis Songbook
OL,6,     FThe line-up changed, the style
OL,7,     Fevolved, but the hits kept coming.
OL,8,     FFrom Peter Gabriel to Phil
OL,9,     FCollins, Invisible Touch to I
OL,10,     FCan't Dance, a documentary that
OL,11,     Fcharts the inspiration of Genesis.
OL,12,G0250 Electric Light Orchestra: Live -
OL,13,G     The Early Years
OL,14,     FA compilation of three ELO
OL,15,     Fconcerts: Fusion Live in London
OL,16,     F(1976), plus unreleased shows at
OL,17,     FBrunel University (1973) and
OL,18,     FGermany's Rockpalast (1974).
